{"item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/baycitybike/items/81664/", "pk": 81664, "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/baycitybike/", "pk": 4476, "shortname": "baycitybike", "name": "Bay City Bike", "processor_currency": "usd", "display_processor_currency": "US dollars"}, "name": "Alcatraz & the Golden Gate Bridge to Sausalito Tour", "is_retail": false, "is_archived": false, "is_private": false, "color": 1, "unicode": "Alcatraz & the Golden Gate Bridge to Sausalito Tour", "is_bookable_ever_by_phone": true, "sold_out_text": "Call for Availability", "cutoff_unreached_kind": "before-midnight", "cutoff_unreached_hours": 96.0, "is_cutoff_unreached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_unreached_call_to_book_text": "", "cutoff_reached_kind": "before-midnight", "cutoff_reached_hours": 96.0, "is_cutoff_reached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_reached_call_to_book_text": "", "minimum_initial_party_size": 1, "minimum_subsequent_party_size": 1, "maximum_initial_party_size": null, "maximum_subsequent_party_size": null, "auto_open_kind": "before-start", "auto_open_hours": null, "is_waitlist_when_full": false, "is_unlisted": false, "booking_restriction": null, "is_card_required": false, "is_grouped_calendar": true, "is_free_allowed": true, "is_no_tax": true, "sortable_index": 496, "description": "***Alcatraz tour on your booked date; Bike tour the next day at 10:00 AM!***\n\n###Duration\n\nAlcatraz Tour 2 to 3 hours \nBike Tour 2 to 3 hours (Next day at 10 AM)\n\n***This tour is for all ages!***\nBeginner to Novice - All Ages - Family Fun\n_______________________\n\n###Activity details\n\nExperience two of San Francisco’s most iconic adventures with a visit to Alcatraz followed by a guided bike tour across the Golden Gate Bridge on the day after.\n\nOn your selected booking date, head to Pier 33 to board the ferry to Alcatraz Island. Explore the world-famous former prison at your own pace with the immersive audio tour, visit historic exhibits, and enjoy sweeping views of the city before returning to the mainland.\n\nThe next day, meet your guide for a scenic bike tour along San Francisco’s waterfront. Get fitted for your bike and helmet before pedaling toward the towering Golden Gate Bridge. Enjoy photo stops and commentary along the way, then ride across the bridge on a dedicated bike path with breathtaking views of the bay, Alcatraz, and the city skyline.\n\nAfter crossing into Marin, follow the path through Vista Point and down a winding road to the charming bayside town of Sausalito. Spend time exploring galleries, restaurants, and waterfront streets before returning to San Francisco by ferry (tickets sold separately).\n\n***Alcatraz Info***\nAlcatraz departure time will be sent approximately 3 days before your tour. \n\nBoats depart from Pier 33. Arrive a minimum of 30 minutes before your departure. All riders’ names must have been submitted with booking. Riders MUST present ID at tour time.\n\n***Bike Tour Info***\nCheck-in 30 minutes before the tour and meet your guide at ***2661 Taylor Street TOUR CENTER*** in Fisherman’s Wharf.\n\n###What's included\n\n* Official Alcatraz Island visit with award-winning audio tour\n* Round-trip ferry from Pier 33 included\n* 3-hour guided bike tour with an expert local guide.\n* Full-Day bike rental\n* Helmet, lock, and map", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "", "booking_notes": "#Bring a copy of this voucher to redeem your tours!\n\n**Note, The day you book is the Alcatraz Tour**\n\n•  Alcatraz Tour starting time:  This will be sent to you 4 days prior to the reservation date; Typically it is a morning departure time.\n\n•  Bike Tour starting time: 10am. Bike Tour is the day after Alcatraz. This will be reiterated in confirmation sent to you 4 days prior.\n\n•  We take a monetary authorization on all rentals, starting at $100 per regular bike and $500 per Ebike. The authorized amount is held until we have the safe return of all rental equipment.", "cancellation_notes": "#All Alcatraz packages are non-refundable once booked. \n**Cancellation and No-Show Policy:** \n\n• Cancellations and no-shows for Alcatraz Packages are non-refundable. Reservation no shows are charged in full.\n\n**Changed Reservation Dates Policy:** \n\n• Alcatraz trips cannot be modified in anyway. Bike Tour date and times may be re-scheduled as desired by contacting the Reservation desk but are non-refundable.\n\n**Reservation Terms & Conditions**\n\n• FOR ALCATRAZ: Please arrive at Pier 33, Alcatraz Landing, at least 30 minutes prior to your scheduled departure date and time. Failure to do so may result in the cancellation of your trip. Bring ID\n• FOR BIKE TOUR: Please arrive at 2661 Taylor St, at least 30 minutes prior to your scheduled departure date and time. Bring Credit Card and ID.\n• It is not transferable, has no cash value, and may be redeemed only once.", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 15, "headline": "2-Day Alcatraz Ticket & Golden Gate Bridge Bike Tour", "short_description": "2 Day experience: Alcatraz visit + Golden Gate Bridge guided bike tour", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/6g5ddW0TIqlyYdqk721h", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/6g5ddW0TIqlyYdqk721h", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/baycitybike/items/81664/images/141345/", "pk": 141345, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/buHBr3TpS0dFLFrU9XBg", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/buHBr3TpS0dFLFrU9XBg", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/baycitybike/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/baycitybike/items/81664/"}, "crop": {}, "cropped_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/buHBr3TpS0dFLFrU9XBg", "cropped_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/buHBr3TpS0dFLFrU9XBg", "is_low_resolution": false, "has_text_overlay": false, "has_logo_overlay": false}, {"cls": "Image"